 4. 📚 1 fun thing: Romi, the library robot 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Gitanjali Poonia/Axios The country's first library robot helper lives at Arizona's Mesa Gateway Library, Axios Mesa's Gitanjali Poonia reports. 

 Romi is part tour guide, part selfie station — and easily the library's most futuristic helper. 👋🏻 Romi can greet visitors in eight languages and lead them to different sections of the building.

 Visitors can touch the screen on its belly to look up books. Go deeper . 

 
 
